WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.375
Maya runs a bakery. One morning, the online till rings fourteen dollars as forty one.

00:00:07.575 --> 00:00:12.500
The order says fourteen. The screen says forty one. She has until noon.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:21.825
First, remember. The memory map replays how the total was built. And the librarian whispers: you tried this shortcut before.

00:00:23.025 --> 00:00:28.950
Then, argue. Two fixes debate against strict checks. The weaker one loses in the open.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:35.200
Then, build. The laptop dies mid fix. Reopen. Every byte intact.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:42.350
Then, check. Four checks pass, and a signed proof is issued. One tampered byte gets sealed off.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:50.500
One day, act. The fix clicks through the shop itself and verifies the total. Drawn, not built. A seed.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:57.475
Beside every dream, a receipt. Ten million memories, filed, measured, replayable.

00:00:59.275 --> 00:01:03.900
And the map stays honest.  It is a map, not a machine.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:09.900
One wrong total. Five stops.  Open the map.
